This is a placeholder for the contract PDF file.

To use a real PDF contract:
1. Replace this file with an actual PDF document
2. Update the contractPdfUrl in the component to point to your PDF
3. The PDF will be displayed in the iframe within the modal

For testing purposes, you can:
- Use a publicly available PDF URL
- Host your PDF file in the assets folder
- Use a PDF service or API to generate contracts dynamically

Example PDF URLs you can use for testing:
- https://www.w3.org/WAI/ER/tests/xhtml/testfiles/resources/pdf/dummy.pdf
- Any other publicly accessible PDF URL 